[Alternative Ladder Handling]
// - Only the action button can jump off a ladder
// - Can look left and right as well as up and down while on a ladder
//   (off by default)
//
// BE CAREFUL!! If you are looking away from the ladder while climbing
// and reach the top, you will immediately start moving forward and
// likely accidentally jump off. :D If this doesn't concern you, comment
// out the marked section to enable looking left/right on a ladder.
//
// NOTE: YOU MUST COMMENT ALL 3 SECTIONS TO DISABLE ALTERNATIVE HANDLING.
//       YOU MUST UNCOMMENT THE FIRST SECTION TO UNCOMMENT EITHER OF THE
//       LAST TWO.
//       YOU MUST UNCOMMENT ONE (AND ONLY ONE) OF THE LAST TWO.
/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
